# Repo-wide ignores. The RAG project has its own .gitignore in
# "AI powered Samsung user guide/" for rules specific to that subtree.

# Samsung's manuals are copyrighted and are not redistributed; the store, the
# embedding cache and the extracted figures are all rebuildable from them via
# `python -m ingest`. Nothing under data/ belongs in the repo.
#
# NOTE: data/ is currently *tracked* despite this rule — see the root CLAUDE.md.
# An ignore rule does not untrack an already-committed path.
data/

# Environments and caches
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Secrets and machine-local notes
.env
CLAUDE.local.md

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
